{
  "title": "The Supplication of Tuesday",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM.\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHE \nAll praise be to Allah;\nوَ الْحَمْدُ حَقُّهٗ كَمَا يَسْتَحِقُّهٗ\nWAL HAMDO HAQQOHU KAMAA YASTAHIQQOHU \nand praise is His right, since He deserves it,\nحَمْدًا كَثِيْرًا\nHAMDAN KASEERAN \nabundant praise!\nوَّ اَعُوْذُ بِهٖ مِنْ شَرِّ نَفْسِىْ \nWA A-O’OZOBEHI MIN SHARRE NAFSEE\nI seek refuge in Him from the evil of my soul, \nاِنَّ النَّفْسَ لَاَمَّارَةٌ بِالسُّوْٓءِ \nINNAN NAFSA LA AMMAARATUN BIS-SOOE \n“For surely, the soul commands to evil\nاِلَّا مَارَحِمَ رَبِّىْ \nILLAA MAA RAHEMA RABBEE \nexcept as my Lord has mercy.”\nوَ اَعُوْذُ بِهٖ مِنْ شَرِّ الشَّيْطَانِ \nWA A-O’OZO BEHI MIN SHARRISH SHAYTANIL \nI seek refuge in Him from the evil of Satan\nالَّذِىْ يَزِيْدُنِىْ ذَنْۢبًا اِلٰى ذَنْبِىْ \nLAZEE YAZEEDONI ZAMBAN ELAA ZAMBEE\nwho adds sins to my sin.\nوَ اَحْتَرِزُ بِهٖ مِنْ كُلِّ جَبَّارٍ فَاجِرٍ \nWA AHTAREZO BEHI MIN KULLE JABBAARIN FAAJERIN \nI seek protection with Him from every wicked tyrant,\nوَّ سُلْطَانٍ جَآئِرٍ \nWA SULTAANIN JAA-ERIN \nunjust sovereign,\nوَّعَدُوٍّ قَاهِرٍ \nWA A’DUWWIN QAAHERIN \nand conquering enemy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِىْ مِنْ جُنْدِكَ \nALLAAHUMMAJ A’LNEE MIN JUNDEKA \nO Allah, place me among Your troops,\nفَاِنَّ جُنْدَكَ هُمُ الْغَالِبُوْنَ \nFA-INNA JUNDAKA HOMUL GHAALEBOONA \nfor Your troops—they are the victors, \nوَاجْعَلْنِىْ مِنْ حِزْبِكَ \nWAJ-A’LNEE MIN HIZBEKA\nand place me in Your party,\nفَاِنَّ حِزْبَكَ هُمُ الْمُفْلِحُوْنَ \nFA-INNA HIZBAKA HOMUL MUFLEHOON\nfor Your party—they are the ones who prosper,\nوَاجْعَلْنِىْ مِنْ اَوْلِيَآئِكَ \nWAJ-A’LNEE MIN AWLEYAAA-EKA\nand place me among Your friends,\nفَاِنَّ اَوْلِيَآئَكَ لَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ\nFA-INNA AWLEYAA-AKE LAA KHAWFUN A’LAYHIM \nfor Your friends—no fear shall be upon them, \nوَ لَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُوْنَ\nWA LAA HUM YAHZANOON\nnor shall they experience sorrow. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَصْلِحْ لِىْ دِيْنِىْ \nALLAAHUMMA ASLEH LEE DEENEE\nO Allah, set right for me my religion,\nفَاِنَّهٗ عِصْمَةُ اَمْرِىْ \nFA-INNAHU I’SMATO AMREE \nfor it is the preserving tie of my affair; \nوَ اَصْلِحْ لِىْ آخِرَتِىْ \nWA ASLEH LEE AAKHERATEE\nset right for me my hereafter,\nفَاِنَّهَا دَارُ مَقَرِّىْ \nFA-INNAHAA DAARO MAQARREE\nfor it is the abode of my permanent lodging\nوَ اِلَيْهَا مِنْ مُجَاوَرَةِ اللِّئَامِ مَفَرِّىْ\nWA ELAYHAA MIN MOJAAWARATIL LE-AAME MAFARREE\nand to it I flee from the neighborhood of the vile!\nوَاجْعَلِ الْحَيٰوةَ زِيَادَةً لِىْ فِىْ كُلِّ خَيْرٍ \nWAJ A’LIL HAYAATA ZEYAADATAN LEE FEE KULLE KHAYRIN\nMake life an increase for me in every good\nوَالْوَفَاةَ رَاحَةً لِىْ مِنْ كُلِّ شَرٍّ \nWAL WAFAATA RAAHATAN LEE MIN KULLE SHARRIN\nand death an ease for me from every evil!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, send blessings to Muhammad,\nخَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ \nKHAATAMIN NABIYYEENA\nthe Seal of the Prophets\nوَ تَمَامِ عِدَّةِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ \nWA TAMAAME I’DDATIL MURSALEENA\nand the completion of the number of the envoys, \nوَ عَلٰى آلِهِ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ \nWA A’LAA AALEHIT TAYYEBEENAT TAAHEREENA \nand upon his Household, the good, the pure,\nوَ اَصْحَابِهِ الْمُنْتَجِبِيْنَ \nWA ASHAABEHIL MUNTAJEBEENA\nand upon his Companions, the distinguished,\nوَ هَبْ لِىْ فِىْ الثُّلَاثَآءِ ثَلاَثًا\nWA HAB LEE FIS SOLAASAA-E SALAASAN\nand give me on Tuesday three things:\n لَا تَدَعْ لِىْ ذَنْبًا اِلَّا غَفَرْتَهٗ \nLAA TADA’ LEE ZAMBAN ILLAA GHAFARTAHU\nLeave no sin for me unless You forgive it, \nوَ لَا غَمًّا اِلَّا اَذْهَبْتَهٗ \nWA LAA GHAMMAN ILLAA AZHABTAHU\nno grief unless You take it away,\nوَلاَ عَدُوًّا اِلَّا دَفَعْتَهٗ\nWA LAA A’DUWWAN ILLAA DA-FA’TAHU\nand no enemy unless You repel him!\nبِبِسْمِ اللهِ خَيْرِ الْاَسْمَآءِ \nBE-BISMIL LAAHE KHAYRIL ASMAAA-E\nIn the name of “In the name of Allah,” the best of the Names, \nبِسْمِ اللهِ رَبِّ الْاَرْضِ وَالسَّمَآءِ \nBISMIL LAAHE RABBIL ARZE WAS SAMAAA-E\nIn the name of Allah, the Lord of the earth and the heaven, \nاَسْتَدْفِعُ كُلَّ مَكْرُوْهٍ اَوَّلُهٗ سَخَطُهٗ \nASTADFE-O’ KULLA MAKROOHIN AWWALOHU SAKHATOHU\nI seek to repulse every hateful thing, the first of which is His anger,\nوَ اَسْتَجْلِبُ كُلَّ مَحْبُوْبٍ اَوَّلُهٗ رِضَاهُ \nWA ASTAJ-LEBO KULLA MAHBOOBIN AWWALOHU REZAAHO\nand I seek to attract every lovable thing, the first of which is His good pleasure!\nفَاخْتِمْ لِىْ مِنْكَ بِالْغُفْرَانِ \nFAKHTIM LEE MINKA BIL GHUFRAANE\nSo, seal me with forgiveness from You, \nيَا وَلِىَّ الْاِحْسَانِ.\nYAA WALIYYAL EHSAAN.\nO Patron of beneficence!"
}
